; the budgets, in a file of their own
2024-01-01 budget Groceries CNY
  alias: "Groceries & household"
  category: "Daily"
  owner: "both"
2024-01-01 09:00:00 budget Books CNY ; a budget defined at a time, with an inline comment
  alias: "书"
2024-01-01 budget Daily-Coffee_2 CNY
  category: "Daily"

2024-01-01 budget-add Groceries 1000 CNY
  source: "salary"
2024-01-01 09:30 budget-add Books 100.5 CNY
2024-01-15 budget-add Groceries -50 CNY ; taking money away
2024-01-20 budget-add Daily-Coffee_2 0.001 CNY
2024-02-01 budget-add Books 10 + 20 * 2 CNY
2024-01-31 23:59:59 budget-transfer Groceries Books 25.50 CNY
  reason: "month end"
2024-03-01 18:00:00 budget-close Daily-Coffee_2
  note: "no more coffee"
